    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "Inspect the Dust visual effect created for this scene.\r\n\r\n1. In the <i>Hierarchy,</i> select <b>VFX</b> > <b>FloatingDust Cage.</b>\n\r\n2. Toggle it on and off in the <i>Inspector.</i>\r\n\r\nNotice how the dust particles contribute to the realism of the Scene.\r"
