  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "<b>Visual effects</b> that are located in the <b>Assets</b> > <b>Particles</b> folder are called <b>Visual Effect Graphs.</b> You can edit them using the Visual Effect Graph window.\r\n\r\nThis node-based editor enables creators to design advanced GPU-based effects.\r"
